flowchart TB
  F["founder 一条授权消息<br/>FLY-2496 AUTHORIZE register cutover=9d63a2b2 urgent-restart baseline=quiet15m"] --> H1["H1 Lead: 建工作区 + 接 Codex 账号<br/>(不改变谁在回 #raya)"]
